    "html": "<h1>Assessments</h1>\n<p>Modules 1–4 contribute <strong>50% of the full-course grade</strong>. The proposal and audit report with its deck are team submissions. Discussions, practice, oral defenses, and reflections are individual. Canvas supplies team assignments, exact dates, and submission links.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Component</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Module</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Within Part 1</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Full Course</th>\n<th>Instructions</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Discussion 1</td>\n<td>Individual</td>\n<td align=\"right\">1</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10%</td>\n<td align=\"right\">5%</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M1A1_Discussion_1.md\">Read</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M1A1_Discussion_1.docx\">Word</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Discussion 2</td>\n<td>Individual</td>\n<td align=\"right\">2</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10%</td>\n<td align=\"right\">5%</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M2A1_Discussion_2.md\">Read</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M2A1_Discussion_2.docx\">Word</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Discussion 3</td>\n<td>Individual</td>\n<td align=\"right\">3</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10%</td>\n<td align=\"right\">5%</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M3A1_Discussion_3.md\">Read</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M3A1_Discussion_3.docx\">Word</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Project Part 1: research proposal</td>\n<td>Team</td>\n<td align=\"right\">2</td>\n<td align=\"right\">25%</td>\n<td align=\"right\">12.5%</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M2A2_Project_Part_1.md\">Read</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M2A2_Project_Part_1.docx\">Word</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Project Part 2: audit report and deck</td>\n<td>Team</td>\n<td align=\"right\">4</td>\n<td align=\"right\">30%</td>\n<td align=\"right\">15%</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M4A1_Project_Part_2.md\">Read</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M4A1_Project_Part_2.docx\">Word</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Project Part 2: oral defense (M4A3)</td>\n<td>Individual</td>\n<td align=\"right\">4</td>\n<td align=\"right\">5%</td>\n<td align=\"right\">2.5%</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M4A1_Project_Part_2.md\">Read</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M4A1_Project_Part_2.docx\">Word</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reflection memo</td>\n<td>Individual</td>\n<td align=\"right\">4</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10%</td>\n<td align=\"right\">5%</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M4A2_Reflection.md\">Read</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M4A2_Reflection.docx\">Word</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Audit practice notebook</td>\n<td>Individual</td>\n<td align=\"right\">3</td>\n<td align=\"right\">Ungraded</td>\n<td align=\"right\">Ungraded</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M3A2_Audit_Practice.md\">Read</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M3A2_Audit_Practice.docx\">Word</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Total</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><strong>100%</strong></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><strong>50%</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Team work contributes 27.5 percentage points to the full course and individual work contributes 22.5. Each team submits one proposal and one audit package. Each member receives a separate oral-defense score. Modules 5–8 contribute the remaining 50% of the course grade.</p>\n<p>Use the <a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M1_4_Project_Templates_and_Collection_Guide.md\">Project Templates and Collection Guide</a>, also available in <a href=\"https://github.com/nene88991999/MSBAi_QuantumCognition/blob/main/02_Assessments/M1_4_Project_Templates_and_Collection_Guide.docx\">Word</a>, for the six-condition design, AI Attribution Log, contribution record, and revision record. The <a href=\"#python\">Python folder</a> contains the individual practice notebook and the team project analysis starter.</p>\n<p>The team presents for ten minutes. Each member then completes a five-minute oral defense without live AI assistance or teammate prompting. Review the separate team and individual rubrics in M4A1. Each student writes their own reflection under its stated AI policy.</p>\n<p>The <a href=\"#sessions\">live-session guides</a> identify the individual preparation and team work to bring. Keep graded submissions and raw interview records in the approved private location. No supplied notebook makes paid model calls.</p>\n",
